window.products.push({"id":509255,"name":"82 PCS Gold Neutral Baby Shower Decorations for Boy or Girl - Jumbo Transparent Baby Block Balloon Boxes, BABY, A - Z Letters DYI Gold White Pink Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J6SG3bCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SO MANY WAYS TO USE: Your baby shower only happens once. Make it a magical event to remember with breathtaking decorations that elicit lots of “oohs,” “ahhs” and “where’d you GET those?!” With translucent display boxes and vibrantly colored balloons, they’re perfect for 1st birthday decorations, gender reveals, newborn photos, pregnancy announcements and more! 36 BALLOONS + 4 BOXES + 42 LETTERS: Why buy baby shower balloons separately when you can get everything in one easy-to-use kit? Other decorations only come with a few boxes and leave it up to you to supply the rest. Our gorgeous set comes with 4 transparent boxes, 36 beautiful balloons - available in boy, girl and neutral colors! You’ll also get 4 sets of “BABY”for all four sides (other kits do not come with 4 set of letters) + A-Z Alphabet letters to DYI names, GRAD, LOVE, KISS, HOME AND MORE PREMIUM-QUALITY MATERIALS: To make sure your special moment gets all the attention it deserves, we’ve thoughtfully crafted each of our decorations with high-quality materials that last. Our balloon boxes are made with PREMIUM 350MSG carstock paper and other non-toxic materials, and our thick balloons are built strong for years of joy-filled parties and celebrations. FRUSTRATION-FREE ASSEMBLY + LETTER BOOK PDF: With pre-folded boxes, a visual step-by-step instruction guide and easy-stick letters, setting up your baby shower centerpieces is stress-free and easy! When you’re finished with your decorations, just fold them back down and take them out again when you’re ready to throw another amazing event or share with an expecting friend! We even included a BONUS PDF A- Z Letter book to print more letters, numbers & symbols as needed + an Inspiration photo guide NO HELIUM REQUIRED: Forget about buying a fancy helium machine or visiting your local grocery store to fill up your gender reveal balloons. All they need is a bit of good old-fashioned air! Just blow them up, insert inside your baby block decorations and close the box for some seriously stunning gender reveal decor! Great for birthdays, christening, name decor, bridal showers, kid's party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J6SG3bCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REGAL DECORATIONS","source_asin":"B0C1X4B86Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1X4B86Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1X4B86Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
