window.products.push({"id":509292,"name":"Hitesya Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, Non-Stick Air Fryer Liners, Parchment Paper for Air Fryer Oil-proof, Water-proof, Food Grade Air Fryer Paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UJsgsZiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RELIABLE AND SAFE - The Air Fryer Liners Disposable is made of food-grade parchment paper, which is oil proof, water proof and non-stick. 100% healthy, and has good heat resistance. It can withstand temperatures of up to 428℉ while retaining the flavor of the food. We pay more attention to the health and hygiene of the materials. KEEP YOUR AIR FRYER CLEAN - These air fryer paper liners effectively keep food scraps out of the fryer and keep them as clean as unused, saving time and effort. If you hate cleaning your air fryer after baking, you'll love these airfryer parchment liners. EASY TO USE - The air fryer liner has a round bowl shape that doesn't need to be torn, folded, cut or bent, just drop right in when you're ready to cook. The 1.77-inch raised rim protects the sides of the fryer and prevents food from sticking to it. (Note: Please do not heat the air fryer filter paper alone without food to prevent it from being blown to the heating pipe by air flow and causing fire) WIDE APPLICATIONS - These air fryer parchment paper liners can be applied for baking, roasting, frying, air fryer, microwave, steamer, or serving food, suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, and so on, light and practical. NO INTERFERING INTERNAL AIR CIRCULATION - The heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, and it won't affect the air circulation by using disposable paper liners. When baking, the grease comes out to the paper liner, giving you healthier foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UJsgsZiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hitesya","source_asin":"B0B2X129D8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2X129D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2X129D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
