window.products.push({"id":509310,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld, Rechargable Coffee Foam Maker with Stand & 2 Whisks, Wanderland 3 Speeds Electric Coffee Mixer for Coffee, Lattes, Cappuccino, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716jKRciM7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Rich Foam in Seconds - By using double spring whisk and powerful motor, our electric milk frother can create a thick and creamy milk foam in a shorter time than other single spring whisk. It is a perfect drink mixer for coffee, latte, cappuccino, matcha, hot chocolate, protein powder drinks and any other drinks. 3-Speed Adjustable - Our coffee frother handheld has 3 speeds for you to choose from low to high. You can choose different speed to achieve ideal frother effect. Simple one push to turn on/off 3 different power levels. No need to hold the power button for 3 seconds of mess before it turns off. Rechargeable Handheld Frother - Our rechargeable coffee frother is powered by the built-in battery, no need to replace battery frequently and eco-friendly.You can charge it anywhere and anytime. The frother whisk is perfect for your daily use. Easy to Clean and Store - The milk foamer frother comes with a durable convenient metal stand that sits nicely next to other coffee accessories when stored on counter or table. This handheld frother can be placed on the stand even halfway through the operation to keep your table or countertop clean and organized. After using, just put the whisk in hot running water and turn it on, instantly clean in a few seconds. Ideal Gifts - The coffee foam maker is lightweight, handy and multifunctioanl, makes ita perfect gift to your family and friends to enjoy the fun of making their favorite drinks. Any problem please contact us, we will provide the best solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716jKRciM7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WanderLand","source_asin":"B092YYP471","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092YYP471","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092YYP471","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
