window.products.push({"id":509313,"name":"Ciroa White Ceramic Pie Dish Large 9 Inch Size Porcelain Plate for Baking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FO0188BzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE. This 9.8\" / 25cm pie dish (2 quart / 1900ml) is perfect for all your pie baking needs and also looks great for serving. QUALITY. Made from quality porcelain, this pie dish is durable and made to last - they have been high fired for extra durability and resist cracking and crazing. SAFE & EASY TO CLEAN. This pie plate is safe to use for baking in the oven or microwave, and when it comes to cleaning it is also dishwasher safe. DESIGN. The unique \"crackle glaze\" design of this white pie dish was created in our studio in Sydney, Australia. More of our designs can be viewed on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FO0188BzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ciroa","source_asin":"B07Z7F1N9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z7F1N9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z7F1N9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
