window.products.push({"id":509315,"name":"HOMCA Cube Memory Foam Pillow - Cube Pillow(24\"x12\"x5.9\") for Side Sleepers Support Head & Neck for Pain Relief, Free Adjustment of Firmness and Heigh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qzmRwn+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌟【Perfect Shape Relief Pain】- The cube shape fits perfectly and supports the 90° space between your head and neck, allowing your spine to be adjusted. It also provides good head support and reduces pressure on the shoulders, which can help relieve shoulder and neck pain. It allows you to fall asleep undisturbed and wake up feeling refreshed. 🌟【Customized Adjustable Softness/Firmness】- HOMCA square pillow's unique layered design allows pillows to come in three kinds of softness(45D/55D/65D). You can combine memory foam according to your sleep needs to achieve a fully ergonomic sleep. Whether you lie on your back or on your side, brings you a good sleep experience. 🌟【Layered Design for Height Adjustment】- Our memory foam pillow with dimensions of 24 x 12 x 5.9 inches (L x W x H). The unique 3-layer design offers 4 different options for neck support heights. If you feel that the height of the pillow is not enough to meet your sleep needs, please contact us to get a booster pad (0.8 inches thick). Booster pad also provide more freedom of choice to achieve the most comfortable configuration and ease your neck and shoulder pain. 🌟【Ear Hole Pressure Relief】- Hollow design can relieve the friction and pressure of the ear when lying on the side, while maintaining air circulation, increasing the ear movement space, will not be uncomfortable ear tossing and turning. If you have difficulty sleeping on your side because of ear disease or injury, HOMCA ear hole pillow is ideal. 🌟【High-quality Material】- The core of cube pillow is made of high-quality memory foam that can sense body temperature to match softness, providing the most stable comfort. Pillowcase has good air permeability, air circulation inside and outside the pillow core, keep the pillow core dry. Dustproof inner cover effectively prolongs the service life of the pillow core. Hidden zipper is easy to clean pillowcase. (Machine/hand washable) 🌟【Worry-free Shopping】- HOMCA is committed to providing customers with high-quality products and 100% satisfactory service. Purchasing the right pillow to eliminate neck pain is an important step in improving your sleep, and if you need any assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qzmRwn+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCA","source_asin":"B0C1GRY4RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1GRY4RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1GRY4RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
