window.products.push({"id":509343,"name":"Premium Salt and Pepper Grinder - 2 in 1 Salt and Pepper Mill - by Decodyne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Tacy+JzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There's a reason why the waiters at those fancy restaurants offer you pepper and salt that have been freshly ground! Both seasonings simply taste better when they're ground fresh right onto your plate. With the Decodyne 2 in 1 Salt & Pepper Grinder Set, you don't have to wait until a special occasion to enjoy the taste sensation of freshly ground pepper or salt. You can add the perfectly fresh seasoning to your recipes each and every day with one single, affordable kitchen gadget! The Decodyne 2 in 1 Salt & Pepper Grinder Set is a single, easy to grip grinder that stores pepper on one side and salt on the other. \"S\" and \"P\" markings tell you which end corresponds to which of the BPA-free acrylic chambers. High quality, efficient grinders are mounted on each end, so you simply turn the barrel in the right direction, pop off the lid and twist to dispense fresh, perfectly ground salt or pepper! The grinding mechanisms turn smoothly and won't become clogged or get stuck, ensuring quick dispensing on demand. Designed to be as stylish as it is practical, the Decodyne 2 in 1 Salt & Pepper Grinder Set can be placed right on the table for passing instead of those old-fashioned salt and pepper shakers. The combination of stainless steel and wood makes the grinder sleek and modern while ensuring that it's durable enough to stand the test of time. When the meal is over, just put the grinder away in the cupboard or leave it on the counter until it's time to eat again. The unique design of the grinder barrel keeps freshness locked inside so you can store your seasonings in it. Don't waste money on separate salt and pepper grinders when you can get the job done even better with just one! Give your recipes that restaurant quality finishing touch with freshly ground seasoning the simple way. Order the best of the grinders for pepper and salt on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Tacy+JzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decodyne","source_asin":"B00WZSA4II","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WZSA4II","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WZSA4II","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
