window.products.push({"id":509452,"name":"Pasoun Cordless Top Down Bottom Up Window Blinds, Blackout Blinds for Indoor Windows, Single Cell Honeycomb Blind & Shade for Home Kitchen Bedroom Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":113.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z9wDt0eLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pasoun Cordless Blackout Top Down Bottom Up Honeycomb Cellular Shade - are amongst the most popular & modern window coverings. Window Coverings Shades Best for : Blinds for bedroom windows :  100% Blackout,Protecting Privacy,Noise reduction Let you have a comfortable and secure sleep environment. Living room and Kitchen Shades blinds : There is a air barrier layer among the double fabrics, Saving energy and keeping room warm. The top down bottom up feature has a variety of opening and closing options to meet different needs. Office blinds for windows : The hexagonal honeycomb structure forms a unique air circulation barrier that not only brings a high-end layered look, But also effectively blocks heat. Study Room Shades : Can effectively reduce outdoor noise interference,reading and learning more comfortable and efficient. Cordless cellular Blinds Cordless window shades creates a safer environment for homes with children and pets. It provides a clean,tangle-free look to the window. Double Color Shades & Durable Non-woven Fabric Fashionable and concise design-This blackout cellular shades have two color on each side, Both side can be installed. easy to install. The fabric is soft to the touch and durable,and do not collect dust easily. Providing sufficient light control and UV protection.100% blackout and complete privacy. Also helps to insulate from heat and noise. Can be clean by cloth or feather duster. Aluminum alloy top track & Vertical Wind-resistant Lower Rail It is easy to raise or lower the shade at any position and will stay at whatever position you stop. Double reel & Double handle Honeycomb shades with double bearing design,low rotational resistance,labor-saving and silent,durable. The cellular blinds is designed with double handles to open and close more smoothly and effortlessly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z9wDt0eLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pasoun","source_asin":"B0BK9895H9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK9895H9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK9895H9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":509453,"name":"Linden Sweden Original Jonas Vegetable Peelers for Kitchen | Made In Sweden | Carrot Peeler with Ergonomic Handle for Safety and Control | Dishwasher ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fM6tLDF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who Says Meal Prep Has to Be a Chore? Apple pie, potato soup and other comfort foods are undeniably delicious – but they also require a lot of prep work. Attempting to peel produce with a knife is both dangerous and ineffective, while electric peelers are far from reliable. Fast, efficient and a classic kitchen staple, the Fruit and Vegetable Peeler by Linden Sweden makes food prep easier than ever! The secret is in our razor-sharp blades, which are designed to resist dulling, even with daily use. From tough squash to delicate cucumbers, you’ll quickly remove peels as the precision ground swivel glides along curves and bumps. Our versatile design accommodates both right and left-handed users, offering total control while you peel! Paired with a soft-grip handle, there’s no cramping or discomfort. When you’re done, just pop it in the dishwasher for a cleanup that’s truly convenient. At 6.5” in length, it takes up minimal space to help maximize your kitchen’s organization! Millions of customers have trusted the Jonas peeler for nearly 6 decades! That’s all thanks to high quality materials like durable plastic and 18/10 stainless steel. Your peeler will remain sharp for years to come, delivering both durability and reliability. Why Choose Our Vegetable Peeler? - Great for fruits and vegetables - Soft-grip handle for comfort - Safe in the dishwasher - Easy to use and store - Made with 18/10 stainless steel Try Today Risk Free with Our 10-Year No-Rust Guarantee! *Stock is limited. Order today to ensure availability. Order Your Peeler Now for Fast, Easy Meal Prep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fM6tLDF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINDEN SWEDEN","source_asin":"B0BCB15QC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCB15QC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCB15QC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
