window.products.push({"id":509470,"name":"Preself Pack of 4,Clear,8.5 oz (250 ml) Plastic Foaming Soap Dispensers,with White Pumps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D201Z5bxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"People who had Used said: 1.These are easy to fill and a squirt gives you plenty to wash your hands or face with but not more than you need. I like to use castile soap because it's so gentle, but it is a bit spendy so I love these dispensers because they prevent waste. 2.These word great! I make my own hand soap using a combination of distilled water, castille soap, jojoba oil, and essential oils. The pump works great and does not get stuck in the \"down\" position. The first few times you push the top down, it makes a horrendous squeaky sound that will really freak out your dog if you have one. Do not fear! This will stop as soon as the soap starts to come through. 3.If there are any other questions about your parcel,please feel free to contact me,I am very delighted to help you always.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D201Z5bxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Preself","source_asin":"B01MQ42807","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MQ42807","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MQ42807","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
