window.products.push({"id":509491,"name":"Küchenprofi Stainless Steel Saucepan with Clad Bottom, 16-Ounce,Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MY0Qbui+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL GRADE: This mini sauce pan is perfectly balanced and weighted with a comfortable, sturdy, ergonomically shaped handle. Whenever you use our Küchenprofi Stainless Steel Saucepan with Clad Bottom, you become a chef in your own kitchen. Stainless steel cookware doesn't get any better than this. This saucepan is so well designed that you will be inspired to try new recipes often and without fuss!. SUITABLE FOR ALL COOKTOPS: Küchenprofi has the right cookware for every dish. High quality stainless steel provides cooking pleasure at the professional level. Whether you are melting butter or heating syrup for your latest recipe, this little saucepan is the perfect warmer, boiler, and cooking pot to use when prepping your next recipe. Küchenprofi cookware is suitable for any stovetop, including gas, electric, and induction. STAINLESS SAUCEPAN: This small cooking pot has an approximately 5-inch diameter and a 4.75” handle with a 0.5-quart capacity. This saucepan is made of 100% 18/8 stainless steel and features 2 spouts for easy, carefree pouring. It is suitable for both left-handed and right-handed use. It has been designed to the highest quality standards with a clad bottom base and a welded handle. For further convenience and precision, there are graduated ml markings on the inside of the pot. VERSATILE AND CONVENIENT: Go ahead: melt chocolate for a decadent dessert, or heat your favorite sauce without worrying about a hard-to-clean pot on your hands when you're done. This pan is the time saver that you've been looking for in the kitchen. This dishwasher safe, stainless steel cookware is extra easy to clean. When quality cookware is this easy to care for, there's nothing stopping you from melting, boiling, or heating up any small batch recipe your imagination can dream up! TRADITION OF QUALITY: Küchenprofi was founded in Germany in 1923. Designing top-tier items has distinguished this brand as one of the best in the industry. They strive to bring imagination and creativity to the home cook's kitchen and to enhance your overall cooking experience. Frieling has partnered with this brand since 2017 and proudly brings its premium quality hand tools, salt and pepper mills, and more to the US market. Height: 6,5 cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MY0Qbui+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Küchenprofi","source_asin":"B082B3KCJN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082B3KCJN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082B3KCJN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
