window.products.push({"id":509542,"name":"KAIX 50th Anniversary Party Decorations Kit Supplies with Happy Banner Cake Topper, Star Heart Wedding Balloons, Number 50 Year Pennant Banner, Sparkl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812gfcKqsCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL: Latex, paper, acrylic, aluminum foil, glitter cardboard. PACKAGE: Happy 50th anniversary decoration set including: 16PCS glitter gold letter “HAPPY ANNIVERSARY ” with 4pcs champagne cup and diamond banner, 2PCS huge gold letter “ 50 ” foil balloons, 6PCS gold latex balloons, 6PCS black latex balloons, 6PCS white latex balloons, 6PCS gold confetti balloons, 4PCS gold heart star foil balloons, 6PCS paper pom poms (2 gold, 2 black and 2 gray), 12PCS sparkling hanging swirl (6 gold, 6 black), 1PC pennant banner, 1PC acrylic cake topper. DESIGN: With classic color matching, the design is simple and fashionable. Special anniversary party design are prepared carefully, just for celebrating the special and only day in your life, leaving you a unforgettable memory. Please put them in a conspicuous place, they will become a highlight in the decoration of the anniversary party. EASY TO USE: 1.Aluminum film balloons can be inflated with a straw, no knot automatic sealing, support air or helium, but it can't float. 2.Latex balloon and confetti balloon can be inflated by pump, support air and helium. It can float when filled with helium. 3.The anniversary banner and pennant banner can be strung with the white ribbon. NOTICE: 1.Age grading: 3 Years And Up. 2.The letter foil balloons can’t float up even with helium, so you can inflate them with air and stick them to the wall. 3.Since our product is manually measured, there may be a slight error. 4. Due to differences between monitor displays, actual color may be slightly different from picture. 5.To avoid the foil balloons pop, please pay attention to the expansion of them when you inflate air by pump until it’s 80% full. 6.Please don’t worry if there is little bit material smell. Just put it on an airy space for a while, the sm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812gfcKqsCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAIX","source_asin":"B09CNQPCDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CNQPCDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CNQPCDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":509543,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Goat Gizmo by Hippie Hound Studios, 18x24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zf0NZhIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a portrait of a goat painted into the center of the frame. Prominent colors: light blue, white, grey, black, blue, tan Western NC artist Lee haigler Keller has always had a strong connection and love for animals. Her interest in art began with a love of drawing and painting as a young child. In the early 90’s she studied fine art at the community college level then fine art and graphic design at Appalachian state University in Boone, NC. She had a fear of being a ‘starving artist’ and changed directions. She spent 17 years working in Occupational therapy with special needs children before pursuing her dream of being a painter. In 2015 she set out with a 5 year plan of combining her love of art, animals and nature into her dream job. She achieved that dream, quit her ‘real job’ and formed Hippie Hound studios in less than a year! she has done hundreds of commissioned dog portraits which are collected worldwide. She has just began showing her art in galleries. Lee also helps various animal rescue organizations though donations of her art. She enjoys spending her spare time between the mountains and coasts of the Carolinas with her family and ‘pack’ of rescue dogs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zf0NZhIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07ML5GRTT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ML5GRTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ML5GRTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
