window.products.push({"id":509581,"name":"Heart Shaped Paper Napkins for Valentine's Party, Hot Pink (6.5 x 6.5 In, 50 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712OswwkXUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These pink cocktail napkins are perfect for any party or décor setting this Valentines! They are made of premium quality and environmentally friendly 3 ply. The napkins are soft, absorbent and allow an easy disposal. The pink heart napkins can be used at restaurants, bars and even at home. Blue Panda is your source for children’s party supplies that come with big fun at a small price; we look forward to being part of your party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712OswwkXUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLUE PANDA","source_asin":"B07WVSP8QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WVSP8QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WVSP8QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":509582,"name":"Jesus Christ\"Pantocrator\" Classic Icon (L (8x10))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511ezbnMZqL._AC_.jpg","description":"This icon's bold, red background is stunning and must be seen in-person to be fully appreciated. This color, like the gold, represents holiness. Pantocrator, \"almighty,\" is one of the many names of God used in the Bible. It refers to Christ as Sabaoth, \"Lord of Hosts,\" the ruler of all, and the sustainer of the universe. This image of Christ is the most widely-used subject in all of Orthodox Christianity, appearing on the domes and iconostases of churches, as well as on panel icons in homes and chapels everywhere. The Lord appears serious, sometimes even stern, but dispassionate as the eternal God. His right hand is raised in a gesture of blessing. As the Word Incarnate, He holds a Gospel book. When the book is open, it signifies Christ as the Teacher; when it is closed, He is the Judge, with the final verdict known only to Himself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511ezbnMZqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Legacy Icons","source_asin":"B01IU7CEW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IU7CEW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IU7CEW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
