window.products.push({"id":509601,"name":"Hillsdale Furniture Brandi Daybed, Oiled Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":543.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dsrDGBX0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Straightforward and no-frills. The Hillsdale Furniture Brandi Daybed is a twin-size metal daybed with suspension deck included. Its simple design and oiled bronze finish make it versatile enough for use in your living room to provide extra seating or your guest room to accommodate overnight visitors. And -- thanks to closely placed spindles and rounded edges gives the illusion of greater width while maintaining a sleek profile. Which also makes the Brandi Daybed is a practical choice for kids' rooms. Accommodates one twin mattress. Mattress not included. Assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dsrDGBX0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hillsdale","source_asin":"B07PM3T5VD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PM3T5VD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PM3T5VD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":509602,"name":"Intex Comfort Frame Airbed Kit, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEWvw1O8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This bed is so comfortable, it can actually be a permanent sleeping solution to a traditional mattress and box spring. Bed sheets tuck easily and securely around the inner mattress which then slips into the inflated frame. The frame provides more support for the bed, adding a level of comfort and firmness that can rarely be acheived by other beds. This bed can easily be converted into two seperate beds by removing the inner mattress; the frame becomes one bed, and the inner mattress becomes another. Finished with the super soft Velvetaire flocking and unique pillowed headboard for added luxury, this is the premium version of two beds in one! Amazon.com Proving that inflatable beds aren't just for sleepovers anymore, the Intex Comfort Frame airbed is so comfortable, you can actually use it as a permanent alternative to a traditional mattress and box spring. The Comfort Frame is actually two beds in one, with an inner mattress that sits within a soft inflatable frame. When you have guests, you can separate the unit into two separate beds, with one person sleeping on the inner mattress and the other inside the frame. The remainder of the time, the Comfort Frame functions as a single luxuriously comfortable bed, with a unique pillowed headboard for added snugness and tubular chambers on the sides for firmness and support. The Comfort Frame airbed is made using a quality-tested 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 15-gauge vinyl I-beams and 16-gauge sides and bottom. The resulting surface is soft and uniform, and also keeps bedding from slipping off to the side. When used as a single bed, the Comfort Frame also makes it easy to tuck bedding inside the bed frame for a tidier look. And the Comfort Frame is easy to inflate thanks to the high-powered handheld electric pump. The Comfort Frame bed, which is raised 15.5 inches from the floor, supports up to 600 pounds and includes a duffel bag for easy storage and transport. About Intex Helping people have fun for more than 40 years, Intex is the world leader in designing and producing high-quality, innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation. Every Intex product--which includes such items as above-ground pools, pool accessories, pool toys, airbeds, and boats--undergoes an intensive quality control process before it's released to the public. During the manufacturing process, highly trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, from the quality of the raw materials and the calibration of the machines to the making and assembly of each product. The goal is to produce the best possible product at the best possible price. Intex offices are located in such cities as Long Beach, California; WanChai, Hong Kong; Roosendaal, Netherlands; Beaufort, France; and Praha, Czech Republic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEWvw1O8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intex","source_asin":"B0014E0VTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0014E0VTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0014E0VTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
