window.products.push({"id":509627,"name":"25-Count Green LED C9 Christmas Light Set - 16ft Green Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WOO22w+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These bright green LED lights are sure to bring brightness to your home and decorations. Use them for your holiday decor, a wedding, or for everyday household use. LED bulbs are cool to the touch and use much less energy than a traditional incandescent bulb. The UL listing allows these to be used both indoor and outdoor, so whether you choose to use the lights on your Christmas tree or to decorate your yard, we have you covered Product Features:. Color: green bulbs / green wire. Number of bulbs on string: 25. Bulb size: C9. Spacing between each bulb: 8\". Lighted length: 16'. Total length: 17'. 6\" lead cord (from the plug to the first bulb). 6\" tail cord Additional Product Features:. LED lights use 90% less energy. Durable non-glass replaceable bulbs. Cool to the touch. Strand contains a rectifier which eliminates the shimmer and shake in the light set. Lights are equipped with a clamp on the base of each bulb so that you can easily attach the lights to trees, bushes and more!. UL certified and approved for indoor or outdoor use. If one bulb burns out, the rest will stay lit. Comes with replacement bulbs and spare fuses. Contains end-to-end connectors which allows you to connect up to 87 sets together (not to exceed 210 watts). Wire gauge: 22. 120 volts, 60 hertz, .02 amps, 2.4 watts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WOO22w+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B075779PQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075779PQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075779PQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
