window.products.push({"id":509823,"name":"Expresso Stackable Steamer Insert Pans, 6 Quart Pans, Pot in Pot, compatible with Instant Pot Accessories, Lasagna Pan, Food Steamer for Pressure Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D7RrAk+eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Parts Included: 1.Two stackable insert pans2.One Easy - Lift Interlocking Holder with silicon Handle3.Two Lids - a sealing lid and a steaming lid How to use? 1.Take out the stainless steel pans from the holder. 2.Fill food in both pans and cover with chosen lid. (steaming lid for steaming food, sealing lid for cooking or reheating).3.Place the pans back into the holder. 4.Add water to the bottom of the cooker and put the entire set in it ,then cook as normal. Cooking Tips: 1.You may use a single insert or both according to cooking required.2.Make sure you always have enough water to generate the necessary steam.3.The bottom pan cooks a little faster than the top one, the items like meat which need a longer time to cook are better placed in the bottom pan. 4.If cooking pasta or rice, you need add water to both cooker and insert pan. Care and Cleaning： 1.Do not use steel wool, bleach or strong abrasive cleaners to clean the inserts.2. After cleaning, whether by hand or in the dishwasher, please promptly wipe-dry with a soft cloth to avoid spotting, streaking, discoloration, or corrosion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D7RrAk+eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Expresso","source_asin":"B07DYQ3D38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DYQ3D38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DYQ3D38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
