window.products.push({"id":509833,"name":"Florida Vintage Map - Blueprint Map Art - State of Florida Unframed Antique Map","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1eRHVzRk5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a map of the State of Florida as it was in the early 1900s, at the beginning of the 20th century. While the original map first appeared in Rand McNally's Atlas, it was then enhanced by our talented artists, and given a new background. The stunning, dark blue and black, background offers the perfect canvas for the white print - creating a valuable piece of map art. Reminiscent of the old blueprints that were drawn by hand on parchment and India ink, this map offers an incredible level of detail, showcasing cities, towns, counties and other geographical points of interest in the State of Florida. This map will not go unnoticed and will be the perfect accent for a living room, a study or an entryway. It will also look great on a staircase or a hall but can be used as wall decor in a professional setting as well, from lobbies and waiting rooms to conference rooms. Every Hudson Frames art print is of Giclee quality, with art printed on performance archival paper using giclee quality printing and archival-quality ink. Details: UNFRAMED (Photos showing this piece framed are added to showcase different décor ideas and possibilities). Made in the USA. Wall décor art print poster. Guaranteed to not fade or bleed. Shipped well protected in a special packaging box. About us: Here at Hudson Frames, we believe in craftsmanship. We take pride in making each piece of art exquisite. We find happiness in helping customers adorn their walls, creating unique spaces that bring a higher quality of living. Shop with confidence, knowing that each piece of art you buy from us was made in the USA, using local suppliers and local workforce. Check our Amazon store often, as we add new vintage finds every day and our gifted artists come up with unique fresh visuals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1eRHVzRk5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hudson Frames","source_asin":"B07QDZYFL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-509833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QDZYFL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QDZYFL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
